[
  {
    "id": "idle_tip_1",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "有什么不明白的，点我就好~", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "easter_panic_1",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "panic_recover",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "呜哇！刚、刚才什么都没发生哦！", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "...好吧，你见证了游戏还不完善的瞬间。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5},
      {"text": "恭喜获得隐藏成就：「Bug见证者」！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 99
  },
  {
    "id": "easter_panic_2",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "panic_recover",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "又、又来了...这次我假装没看到。", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "放心，我已经偷偷帮你稳住了！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 98
  },
  {
    "id": "easter_panic_3",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "panic_recover",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "开发者大概在某个深夜写下了这段代码...", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5},
      {"text": "没关系，游戏还在跑着呢！继续加油！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 97
  },
  {
    "id": "greet_morning",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "greet_morning",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "早上好！今天也一起守护防线吧。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 5
  },
  {
    "id": "greet_afternoon",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "greet_afternoon",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "下午好~来一局放松一下？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 5
  },
  {
    "id": "greet_evening",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "greet_evening",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "晚上好！夜间战斗，别打瞌睡哦。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 5
  },
  {
    "id": "greet_latenight",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "greet_latenight",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "这么晚了还在玩...要注意休息哦。", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "不过...能陪你打一局我也很开心。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 5
  },
  {
    "id": "session_30min",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "session_30min",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "已经玩了半个小时了，状态不错！", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": true,
    "priority": 3
  },
  {
    "id": "session_60min",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "session_60min",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "一个小时了！休息一下眼睛吧。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "...你不休息？好吧，我陪你。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": true,
    "priority": 4
  },
  {
    "id": "session_90min",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "session_90min",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "一个半小时了！真的该休息了...", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "我都替你的眼睛担心了！", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": true,
    "priority": 4
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_1",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "知道吗？不同塔的攻击方式差别很大哦~", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_2",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "升级比建新塔更划算，记住了吗？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_3",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "道具要用在关键时刻，别浪费了~", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_4",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "Boss关之前多准备准备...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_5",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我最喜欢看你连杀的样子了！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_6",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你说...这些敌人为什么要排着队走过来呢？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 5},
      {"text": "它们就不能绕路吗？想不通。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_7",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "有时候我觉得，防守也是一种哲学。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 5},
      {"text": "在对的地方放对的东西，然后静静等待。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_8",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "今天天气怎么样？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3},
      {"text": "...啊，我只能看到这个战场。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_9",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "塔放在路口能打到更多敌人，这是基本功哦。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_10",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你有没有想过...我不说话的时候在想什么？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 5},
      {"text": "答案是在想下次说什么。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_11",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "听说厉害的指挥官都喜欢少建塔、多升级。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5},
      {"text": "质量比数量重要~", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_12",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "如果现实生活也能「暂停」就好了...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "考试之前暂停复习一百年！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_13",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "每座塔都有自己的个性，就像每个人一样。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_14",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你知道吗，我其实很怕Boss...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "但有你在我就不怕了！大概吧。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_15",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "人生就像塔防——", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3},
      {"text": "你永远不知道下一波会来什么。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "但只要做好准备，就没什么好怕的。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_16",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "散射攻击打群怪超好用，试过吗？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_17",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "好安静...敌人是不是迷路了？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_18",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "选能力的时候别光看颜色。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "有些绿色能力搭配好了比紫色还强！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_19",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我刚在想...如果我也能变成一座塔...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 5},
      {"text": "算了，站着不动太无聊了。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_20",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你觉得先存钱还是先建塔？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "我觉得都行，关键是要有计划。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_21",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "隐身的敌人最讨厌了，塔还打不到它们...", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_22",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我偷偷告诉你，开发这个游戏的人...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "据说经常通宵。真是辛苦呢。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_23",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "失败了也没关系，每次都能学到新东西。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5},
      {"text": "下次一定行！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_24",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "有人说最好的防守就是进攻。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "在塔防里...好像反过来才对？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_25",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "喝水了吗？记得补充水分哦。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_26",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "弹跳攻击能打到后面的敌人，适合对付长队列。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_27",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你说，敌人的世界里有没有「人防」游戏？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 5},
      {"text": "就是...建敌人来突破塔的防线那种？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_28",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "战灵的能力充好了别忘了用，CD不等人的。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_29",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "做任何事都是一样的道理：", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3},
      {"text": "与其追求完美，不如先把眼前的事做好。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_30",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "分裂怪死的时候会变成小怪，要小心！", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_31",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我在想一个很深刻的问题...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "今天中午吃什么好呢？", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_32",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "高强度的塔伤害更高，但别忽略攻速哦~", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_33",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "旋转攻击能扫到周围所有敌人。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "放在路中间效果拔群！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_34",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "有时候什么都不做也是一种策略。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "比如现在，我们就在等最好的时机。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_35",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你是那种会反复挑战同一关的人吗？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "我喜欢这种不服输的精神！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_36",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "也不知道什么样的阵容才是最强的...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "是不是已经被你发现了呢？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_37",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你说，打完这关Boss之后...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "后面还会有什么在等着我们呢？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_38",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你说，开发者自己能不能通关呀？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "说不定他调了半天数值，自己还没打过。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_39",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "有没有试过全用同一种攻击方式？", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "还是说...混搭才是你的风格？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_40",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我总觉得有些能力组合在一起会特别厉害...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 5},
      {"text": "就差一个人去验证了——比如你？", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_41",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "每张地图的地形都不一样。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "同样的阵容换张图可能就不好使了哦~", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_42",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你有没有想过只造一座塔就通关？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "把所有资源砸一座塔上...超级强化！", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "不知道行不行，但想想就很刺激。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_43",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "据说有人零损失通关了极难模式...", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "是传说吧？还是真有这种大佬？", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_44",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "每种战灵的玩法完全不同呢。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "你最喜欢哪一个？都试过了吗？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_45",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "减速加高攻...还是控制加范围...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "搭配这种事，越想越上头！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_46",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "后面的关卡敌人会越来越离谱的...", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "你准备好了吗？", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_47",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你发现了吗？有些敌人会给同伴加速。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "优先打掉它们，不然后面一大串就溜过去了！", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_48",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "如果你觉得太简单了...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3},
      {"text": "试试更高难度？我不会笑你的。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "...大概。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_49",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "治疗型敌人会给同伴恢复血量。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "集火它们！不然打了等于没打。", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 4}
