    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_56",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我有时候会想...如果我有自己的意识。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "我会做什么呢？大概还是在这里陪你吧。", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_57",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "这个游戏的代码里，好几千行都是关于我的。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5},
      {"text": "受宠若惊！", "expression": "happy", "autoAdvance": 3}
