    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_59",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "有一次测试的时候，我直接从屏幕上消失了...", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 5},
      {"text": "据说那天开发者加班到凌晨三点。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_60",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "你知道吗？在你看不到的地方...", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "有个自动测试系统在反复打这个游戏。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 5},
      {"text": "它可不会心疼我。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_61",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "「Bug不是缺陷，是未被发现的特性」", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "——某位程序员如是说。", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 3}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_62",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "每次游戏更新，我都会偷偷祈祷：", "expression": "idle", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "这次别把我改没了...", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4}
    ],
    "once": false,
    "priority": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "idle_chatter_63",
    "scene": "*",
    "trigger": "idle_chatter",
    "lines": [
      {"text": "我的台词都写在一个JSON文件里。", "expression": "talk", "autoAdvance": 4},
      {"text": "不过你又看不到——哦等等，你不会真去找吧？", "expression": "surprised", "autoAdvance": 5}
